      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَعَرٌ مَطْمُومٌ</span></b>  means <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَعْقُوصٌ</span> [i. e. <i>Hair plaited:</i>
or <i>twisted:</i> &amp;c.]. (S, TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَأْسٌ مَطْمُومٌ</span>
<i>A head of which all the hair is cut off.</i> (K * and
TA in art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">زق</span>.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَطْمُومُ الرَّأْسِ</span> A man <i>having
all the hair of his head cut off.</i> (TA in that art.)

